{
"recipe_id":"10 Breaded Fried Shrimp",
"source_text":"Recipe text（整理后的流程文字）:\n1. 虾去头、去壳，保留虾尾。从虾腹部切开，但背部不要完全切断；去掉虾线，并尽量将虾铺平。\n2. 将虾洗净，加入料酒、盐和少量白胡椒粉，抓匀后腌制约 10 分钟。\n3. 腌好的虾先均匀裹上一层淀粉。\n4. 再裹上鸡蛋液。\n5. 最后放入面包糠中按压，使两面均匀裹上面包糠。\n6. 中小火将虾慢慢炸至金黄色。\n7. 捞出控油，可搭配番茄酱或沙拉酱食用。\nEnglish process:\nremove shrimp heads → peel shrimp while keeping tails → butterfly shrimp → devein → flatten shrimp → rinse → add cooking wine, salt, and white pepper → marinate for 10 minutes → coat with starch → coat with beaten egg → coat with breadcrumbs → deep-fry over medium-low heat until golden → drain → finish",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "虾去头", "text_en": "Remove the shrimp heads.", "start_char": 26, "end_char": 29, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "去壳，保留虾尾", "text_en": "Peel the shrimp, keeping the tails.", "start_char": 30, "end_char": 37, "node_indices": [2, 3], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "从虾腹部切开，但背部不要完全切断", "text_en": "Cut the shrimp open from the belly without cutting all the way through the back.", "start_char": 38, "end_char": 54, "node_indices": [3, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "去掉虾线", "text_en": "Remove the shrimp veins.", "start_char": 55, "end_char": 59, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "并尽量将虾铺平", "text_en": "Flatten the shrimp as much as possible.", "start_char": 60, "end_char": 67, "node_indices": [5, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "将虾洗净", "text_en": "Wash the shrimp thoroughly.", "start_char": 72, "end_char": 76, "node_indices": [6, 7], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 6, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "加入料酒、盐和少量白胡椒粉", "text_en": "Add cooking wine to the shrimp.", "start_char": 77, "end_char": 90, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "加入料酒、盐和少量白胡椒粉", "text_en": "Add salt to the shrimp.", "start_char": 77, "end_char": 90, "node_indices": [7, 9], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "加入料酒、盐和少量白胡椒粉", "text_en": "Add a small amount of white pepper powder to the shrimp.", "start_char": 77, "end_char": 90, "node_indices": [7, 10], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 9, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "抓匀", "text_en": "Mix the shrimp and seasonings evenly by hand.", "start_char": 91, "end_char": 93, "node_indices": [7, 11], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "腌制约 10 分钟", "text_en": "Marinate for about 10 minutes.", "start_char": 94, "end_char": 103, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 11, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "腌好的虾先均匀裹上一层淀粉", "text_en": "First coat the marinated shrimp evenly with a layer of starch.", "start_char": 108, "end_char": 121, "node_indices": [12, 13], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "再裹上鸡蛋液", "text_en": "Then coat the shrimp with beaten egg.", "start_char": 126, "end_char": 132, "node_indices": [12, 14], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "最后放入面包糠中", "text_en": "Finally, put the shrimp into the breadcrumbs.", "start_char": 137, "end_char": 145, "node_indices": [12, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 14, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "按压，使两面均匀裹上面包糠", "text_en": "Press the shrimp so both sides are evenly coated with breadcrumbs.", "start_char": 145, "end_char": 158, "node_indices": [12, 16], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "中小火将虾慢慢炸至金黄色", "text_en": "Slowly fry the shrimp over medium-low heat until golden.", "start_char": 163, "end_char": 175, "node_indices": [16, 17, 18], "edge_indices": [16, 17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 17, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "捞出控油", "text_en": "Remove the shrimp and let the oil drain off.", "start_char": 180, "end_char": 184, "node_indices": [18, 19], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "可搭配番茄酱或沙拉酱食用", "text_en": "Optionally serve the shrimp with ketchup.", "start_char": 185, "end_char": 197, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 19, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "可搭配番茄酱或沙拉酱食用", "text_en": "Alternatively, serve the shrimp with salad dressing.", "start_char": 185, "end_char": 197, "node_indices": [19, 21], "edge_indices": [20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 20, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index"